# Cloudflare Pages SPA fallback with explicit exceptions for PWA/static assets.
#
# Without these exceptions, "SPA fallback" style rewrites can accidentally
# serve the HTML shell for PWA endpoints (manifest/service worker), breaking
# offline + installability checks.

/manifest.webmanifest  /manifest.webmanifest  200
/registerSW.js         /registerSW.js         200
/sw.js                 /sw.js                 200
/workbox-*             /workbox-:splat        200
/assets/*              /assets/:splat         200

/*                     /index.html            200

